      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.boh_shenoute.leipoldt_ed:1-26",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁϥϣⲗⲏⲗ ⲉⲡⲛⲟⲩⲧⲉ ϩⲛϩⲉⲛⲁϣⲁϩⲟⲙ ⲙⲛϩⲉⲛⲣⲙⲉⲓⲟⲟⲩⲉ ⲉⲩ**ⲟϣ** ·",
      "english": "and prayed to God with sighings and many tears;",
